#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.gschema.xml:21
msgid "The location for the manuscripts, defaults to user data directory"
msgstr ""
"Standardno mjesto za spremanje manuskripata je korisnička mapa podataka"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.gschema.xml:30
msgid "Style Variant"
msgstr "Varijanta stila"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.gschema.xml:31
msgid "Use the light or dark variant of the GTK theme"
msgstr "Koristi svijetlu ili tamnu varijantu GTK teme"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Design and write manuscripts"
msgstr "Dizajniraj i piši manuskripte"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Scriptorium is a text editor coupled with a planning tool and a publishing "
"tool. The objective is to provide writers with a simple and complete "
"environment to plan, write and publish e-books."
msgstr ""
"Scriptorium je uređivač teksta u kombinaciji s alatom za planiranje i "
"alatom za objavljivanje. Cilj aplikacije je pružiti piscima jednostavno i "
"cjelovito okruženje za planiranje, pisanje i objavljivanje e-knjiga."

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Scriptorium features are organised around three facets:"
msgstr "Scriptorium je organiziran u tri glavne radnje:"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Plan the list of scenes and story elements of the manuscript."
msgstr "Planiranje popisa scena i elemenata priče manuskripta."

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Write the content of the scenes with a text focused editor."
msgstr "Pisanje sadržaja scena pomoću uređivača s fokusom na tekst."

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Publish your manuscript as an epub after previewing it."
msgstr "Objavljivanje manuskripta u epub formatu nakon pregleda."

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "In addition, some general features are:"
msgstr "Osim toga, neke opće funkcije su:"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Tamni modus"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Versioning of scenes managed via Git"
msgstr "Verzioniranje scena upravljano putem Git-a"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid "Back-end using plain text YAML and HTML files"
msgstr ""
"Pozadinski dio sustava koji koristi obične tekstualne YAML i HTML datoteke"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:49
msgid "Plan the content of the manuscript"
msgstr "Planiraj sadržaj manuskripta"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid "Write and re-arrange the scenes"
msgstr "Piši i preuredi scene"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid "Write and re-arrange the scenes (dark mode)"
msgstr "Piši i preuredi scene (tamni način)"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:61
msgid "Preview and publish the manuscript as an epub file"
msgstr "Pregledaj i objavi manuskript kao epub datoteku"

#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:69
#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:79
#: data/io.github.cgueret.Scriptorium.metainfo.xml.in:88
